sec.p:
However, FLOWR.ROOT distinguishes itself through its capacity for straightforward yet effective finetuning, enabling adaptation to the underlying data distribution and improved modeling of the structure–activity landscape. We finetuned the model using Low-Rank Adaptation (LoRA)47, where weight updates are parameterized as ΔW = BA with \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
